rget=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=b0FyjRA5CWA </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I found &quot;Blood &amp; Chocolate&quot; to be very close to the mark WW :TA are aiming for IMO, but otherwise not that inspiring.<br /> <br /> As for &quot;Night of the Lycan&quot;...I'm pretty sure I commented on this film earlier before it was publically screened right here under this topic, but can't find any references to it. It wasn't so bad, but the monsters were a bit of a let down, I found the ending very ironic. Considering what I wrote in the You-Tube comments as I watched the film.<br /> <br /> Pity &quot;Late Phases&quot; isn't on Netflix anymore.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://scontent-lax3-1.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-xfl1/v/t1.0-9/11999058_1477906402511404_6367649438608181692_n.jpg?oh=70d49fe91b2932b397dc24c5df2764ba&amp;oe=56A3338B\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1056,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1056-wolf-man","user":"Wolf-Man","date":". 05-30-2018, 06:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1056-wolf-man","name":"Wolf-Man","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1056_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"145"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-02T09:45:42-08:00","id":1364779,"title":"","content":"I hate to Necro-post. But I just started watching &quot;The Order&quot; on Netflix and think it's very worthy of this game. <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNo